						<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-secondary">{item.body}</p>
					</div>
				))}
				<p class="text-sm text-secondary">In practice, the parent who has documented their involvement — school records, medical appointment logs, communication history — outperforms the parent making unsubstantiated claims. Evidence beats assertion.</p>
			</div>
