					</div>
				))}
			</div>
			<p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm text-secondary">For detailed age-specific guidance, see <a href="/custody-schedule-by-age/" class="font-semibold text-accent underline decoration-line underline-offset-4 hover:text-primary">Custody Schedule by Age</a> and <a href="/50-50-custody-schedule-for-babies/" class="font-semibold text-accent underline decoration-line underline-offset-4 hover:text-primary">50/50 Custody Schedule for Babies</a>.</p>
